      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 15: Folio 2v, left side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>The fifteenth is to</li>\n<li>sell &lsquo;sainthood&rsquo; [friendship with God] on false pretences.</li>\n<li>\n<p>The sixteenth is to forget your sin.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The seventeenth is</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>to be pleased with yourself.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The eighteenth is to know your deeds too well [exact meaning unclear].</p>\n</li>\n<li>The nineteenth is</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
